WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:35.580
Gilgamesh and Balarant.

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.210
For a hundred years now,

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:41.380
these two star systems have been locked in a war
whose cause long-forgotten.

00:01:42.670 --> 00:01:45.880
As both sides, by now exhausted,
prepared to finally end the war...

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.040
I was ordered into an operation
whose details were kept from me...

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:55.500
There, my destiny was changed
the moment I saw her.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:00.420
She was apparently the military's greatest secret.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:05.710
Since deserting the army,
I'd come to the city of Uoodo.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:12.420
But this battleground city was like hell itself,
and contained every level of depravity.

00:02:12.670 --> 00:02:17.630
BATTLING

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:32.630
Ground control. Ground control.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.210
This is tracker station.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:38.210
Coordinate: 24, Program 1.

00:02:38.460 --> 00:02:41.330
Crisis situation. Crisis situation.

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.880
Rescue value B. Rescue value B.

00:04:01.460 --> 00:04:02.380
Chirico!

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:07.210
Extinguisher fluid. But who...?

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.960
Another second and you woulda been barbecued.

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:26.170
God, those eyes. You look like you
don't trust anyone anymore.

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:32.170
Shouldn't be surprised.

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.670
I know how things are.

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.790
At the height of the war,

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:40.670
they'd take kids who could barely hold a gun
and send you out to the battlefield.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.710
Then, after you've lived in those metal coffins
so long that you don't know what year it is,

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:46.130
they suddenly call a ceasefire.

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.080
You come home and they can't tell you
if your folks or your brother's alive or dead.

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:56.420
They throw you out into the world,
expecting you to feed yourself...

00:04:56.420 --> 00:05:00.670
but all you know how to do anymore is kill.

00:05:02.380 --> 00:05:05.330
What's your point, Old Man?

00:05:08.710 --> 00:05:11.710
Sign up with me. Won't be so bad.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.000
I've got a job for a VOTOMS jockey like you.

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.250
A job?

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:21.670
I'm a good judge of-

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:22.880
Who's there?!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.290
What, you again?

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:29.580
Oh, what's with the cold shoulder all the time?

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:30.330
Hi!

00:05:30.630 --> 00:05:34.580
I hear you've got some work today.
How about hiring a nurse, too?

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:37.920
Don't need one! I'm busy today! Go! Go!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.630
Oh, don't say that. I'm out of work right now.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:41.540
I'll do anything.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.130
Never mind! Go! Go!

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.330
Well then, I've got some news to sell.

00:05:45.580 --> 00:05:46.830
The latest dope!

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.210
The chief of police-

00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:52.630
-is dead, and they've got a new guy. Old news.

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:53.670
Now get out!

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.920
From where I'm standing...

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.460
you've got real talent as a VOTOMS pilot.

00:05:58.460 --> 00:06:02.210
You're as good as any of the guys
in the Red Shoulder brigade.

00:06:03.750 --> 00:06:08.500
I'm sure you must have heard of
Battling once or twice.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.420
Battling?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:15.080
Yeah. Believe it or not,
this city has a bit of a black market.

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:19.500
Why, that...!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:24.000
Shame on you, not serving tea to your guest!

00:06:24.000 --> 00:06:26.080
How can you talk business?

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.750
How delightful to make your acquaintance.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:29.750
Some tea for you?

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:32.960
No one wants any! Now get outta here,
you little alley cat!

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:37.420
Careful! This old fox'll steal the hair
off your butt if you let him.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:39.750
Mind your own business!
And get the hell outta here!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.250
Never mind her. Just sign this.

00:06:45.250 --> 00:06:48.380
It's a contract, so I can be your Battling manager.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:50.790
Go ahead.

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:57.460
You'll have money, luxury.
You won't find a better job.

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.750
That's right. You've decided.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:02.880
Sign this and you'll never have to
worry about anything again.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:08.290
By that time, I'd lost all sense of worth for anything.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:13.880
But then, perhaps, I'd never really felt the world
was worth anything, or that I had a purpose in it.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:18.080
With the man before me urging me on,
I picked up the pen.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.920
Careful! Careful! Read the fine print!

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.500
Don't sign anything before you read it!

00:07:23.500 --> 00:07:25.420
Dammit, you still here, alley cat?!

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:26.330
See ya!
Dammit, you still here, alley cat?! 

00:07:26.330 --> 00:07:27.380
And don't come back!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:33.000
No need to rush into any agreements!

00:07:33.790 --> 00:07:35.500
I know, how about a little proof
before we discuss it?

00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:37.250
Wanna go see some Battling?

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:12.830
The Phantom Lady's come tonight?

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:14.920
Phantom Lady?

00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:17.580
Even I don't know who she is...

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:20.540
but folks talk about her like she's the Grim Reaper.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.630
All right, you got him! Now finish him!

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.790
I'd heard rumors of this.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:29.420
Unemployed veterans like me who would fight
as gambling objects for the city's underworld.

00:09:30.250 --> 00:09:35.380
As the man said, a very familiar scene
was unfolding before my eyes.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:38.290
A scene completed by the presence of one detail.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:42.040
The place was overpowering
with the sense of utter bloodlust.

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:44.330
There was no pretense of restraint here.

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.880
Everywhere was the familiar sense
of danger threatening me.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.130
Hey, Pops!

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.960
I knew you'd pull something like this.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.250
How's business?

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:01.920
Same old, but looks like you got yourself a real find.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.290
Mind your own business.

00:10:03.920 --> 00:10:05.630
Hey, pal! How about some tickets?!

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.000
I'm coming!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:32.080
I've got someone I'd like you all to meet tonight.
This is Chirico. Chirico Cuvie.

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:43.000
Hey, Kid! You crawl around
or are you actually any good?

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.540
Cat got your tongue?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.500
How much AT time do you have, Kid?

00:10:52.670 --> 00:10:54.920
Why, you...! What was your rank and your unit?!

00:10:57.040 --> 00:11:00.540
Come on, answer me! Rank! Unit!

00:11:00.540 --> 00:11:03.710
Hold on! He really can't talk.

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:05.710
No kiddin'?

00:11:05.710 --> 00:11:09.420
I've forgotten. Besides, the war's over.

00:11:09.670 --> 00:11:11.040
You little...!

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:13.000
Lay off and grow up!

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:15.830
Kid, Battling's a dangerous game.

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.920
We just like to know how good
our opponents might be.

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:23.880
He's a strange kid.

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:26.880
Hey, everyone's a little stand-offish
when they first come here.

00:11:27.710 --> 00:11:29.710
Well, he better change or
he'll end up good and hurt.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.170
Be careful.

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:32.500
It's just play fighting.

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.040
What was that?!

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:36.250
You little...  I dare you to say that again!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.080
Hold on, Bomo. This is my new star player.

00:11:39.080 --> 00:11:40.830
If he gets hurt, I can't make any money.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:41.790
Don't back down, Gotho!

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.000
Bomo, stomp that little snot!

00:11:44.000 --> 00:11:45.040
Hold it!

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:48.000
Get him! Teach the little snot a lesson!

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.420
All right! Bomo, how about this to calm you down?

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:56.750
Why don't you show Chirico what Battling's like?

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:59.170
Fine by me. Great idea.

00:11:59.330 --> 00:12:00.790
Gotho, are you nuts?!

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:01.960
Stay outta this, Shephard!

00:12:01.960 --> 00:12:04.170
Let 'em do it! We'll show him!

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:07.830
It's all right, Shephard. I'll take responsibility.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.380
Okay with you, Chirico?

00:12:11.000 --> 00:12:15.040
All right, let's pick out an AT for you.

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.040
It's him!

00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.460
These are the visitor-use ATs.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.960
Choose one you like.They've got every kind here.

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:57.710
Anyway, a regular Battling match involves
hand-to-hand combat, without using live ammo.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.500
The one who disables his opponent wins.

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.420
But be careful! You've pissed these guys off.

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:16.040
If he attacks your cockpit directly,
you can get good and hurt. It's a nasty way to die.

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:18.830
What's wrong?

00:13:19.790 --> 00:13:21.500
Somebody here?

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.920
No one's around. Must be your imagination.

00:13:38.170 --> 00:13:41.880
Nothing strange.
You've just got some pre-game jitters.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:45.210
The sense of kill or be killed.

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:48.380
I'd learned that these feelings of mine
were something special.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.540
Who was it? That guy Bomo
I was going to be fighting?

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:01.830
No, his feelings weren't this intense.

00:14:02.040 --> 00:14:04.500
He was more irritated by me than anything else.

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.210
Then who?

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:28.250
Who's that guy with old man Gotho?

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:32.920
That little snot-nosed kid? He's a new guy.

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:37.540
'Cept his first game's gonna be his last.

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:40.130
Bomo, you're going up against him?

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:42.500
I doubt he'll be much of a challenge.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.210
Let me have him.

00:14:45.880 --> 00:14:48.750
You, Lieutenant? He isn't worth it!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:50.580
I'll teach him the lesson he needs.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.040
I'll take care of him.

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:53.880
But, Sir...

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:56.290
I said I wanted to take care of him!

00:14:56.920 --> 00:14:58.250
Yes, Sir...

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:03.880
And I don't want any of you telling Gotho or the kid
before the match starts! Got that?

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.880
Yeah, why?

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:16.790
He's still alive?

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.670
We can't just let him go.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.630
Yeah, I was surprised to see him, too.

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.630
No, leave it to me. I'll take care of him.

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:29.540
Don't be rash! I'm not saying I don't trust you...
but if the military's behind this-

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:32.830
Idiot's too damned dedicated!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:36.080
I never thought he'd survive.

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:38.500
Unless we do something,
we could all be in trouble.

00:15:39.290 --> 00:15:40.460
Should I go, too?

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:41.670
No.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.960
What's he doing in this city?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:48.540
And is the military behind this?

00:15:48.540 --> 00:15:51.080
That is the question.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.460
Issue a warrant for his arrest!
I want him captured alive!

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.790
Lieutenant, isn't this sorta unfair?

00:16:16.170 --> 00:16:18.630
Putting the new guy into a Real Battle
for his debut fight...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:20.630
You sure he agreed to this?

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.330
Why don't you relax and mind your own business?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.420
A Real Battle, after all this time.

00:16:30.170 --> 00:16:31.540
Calm down, Chirico.

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:34.790
If you keep cool, Bomo isn't that tough.

00:16:57.710 --> 00:16:59.630
Right, keep in line, folks! Thanks, come again.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:00.670
Hey! Congratulations!

00:17:00.880 --> 00:17:03.540
We got some lucky ladies and
gentlemen tonight! Thank you.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:13.250
A Real Battle? I never set up that kind of fight!

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.080
A Real Battle!

00:17:15.080 --> 00:17:17.290
We'll have some happy people tonight!

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:18.460
'Scuse me.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.500
Man, Gotho's really gone all out on this one!

00:17:21.790 --> 00:17:25.290
Chirico! This is for real! We've been tricked!

00:17:26.540 --> 00:17:29.710
Chirico, wait! Don't be stubborn!
You'll never survive!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.380
A new guy versus a Class-A fighter
like Conin in a Real Battle.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:58.670
Place your bets! Now's the time!

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.380
One gildan on Chirico.

00:18:00.380 --> 00:18:01.290
What?

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:03.380
If the new guy wins, I get a hundred back, right?

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.580
If he wins.

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.790
Okay, my dear Coconna. One gildan on Chirico.

00:18:07.790 --> 00:18:09.080
Cut the sarcasm.

00:18:09.500 --> 00:18:10.460
One hundred on Conin!

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:11.210
Right, thank you.

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.540
I'll put twenty on Conin!

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:12.830
Okay!

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:06.330
Kill him!

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.380
The thrills! I can't take it!

00:20:07.580 --> 00:20:10.130
Yeah, you only get this with a Real Battle!

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:46.670
Him! It's him!

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.420
Chirico!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:58.500
You should have died back on Lido, Sgt. Cuvie!

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.210
Lt. Conin!

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:30.710
All right! I knew I was right about him!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.380
He did it! Chirico did it!

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:37.080
There they go!

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:42.170
That clinches it! I want him to be my partner!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:52.880
Well, you've proved how good you are.

00:21:52.880 --> 00:21:54.170
Come on, sign up.

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.920
Things don't normally work like what happened.

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.540
Being a Battling player's small time stuff!

00:21:58.670 --> 00:21:59.630
Join up with me!

00:21:59.630 --> 00:22:01.130
Don't let them fool you!

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:07.130
All they want is to use you.
I'm the best one to be your manager!

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:10.790
This is the police!

00:22:10.790 --> 00:22:12.920
Chirico Cuvie, you are under arrest!

00:22:13.420 --> 00:22:15.080
Surrender yourself quietly.

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:17.790
Run for it, Chirico! Chirico, what's wrong?

00:22:18.380 --> 00:22:20.330
The cops aren't gonna want to listen to us.

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:21.790
Come on, Chirico!

00:22:23.380 --> 00:22:26.380
You should have died back on Lido, Sgt. Cuvie!

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:29.880
Chirico! What's wrong?!

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:30.830
Chirico!

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:45.080
Chirico! I'll talk to the cops!

00:22:45.080 --> 00:22:46.960
I'll get you out somehow!

00:22:54.630 --> 00:22:56.130
NEXT EPISODE

00:22:56.750 --> 00:23:00.420
An unexploded bomb can be
the most dangerous kind of trap.

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:04.170
Silent assassins lying in wait,
sleeping deep in the earth.

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:08.420
When they suddenly awaken,
the false peace is broken.

00:23:08.670 --> 00:23:11.000
Uoodo: a giant trap of a city.

00:23:11.290 --> 00:23:15.130
There, the fuse is lit and
the unexploded bomb awakens.

00:23:15.540 --> 00:23:17.290
Next time, "The Trap"

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:20.080
Chirico is the bomb waiting to explode.

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.540
But will it be self-destruction or guided to its target?

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:24.630
NEXT EPISODE

00:23:20.420 --> 00:23:24.630
THE TRAP

00:23:42.880 --> 00:23:46.330
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.330 --> 00:23:49.880
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.880 --> 00:23:56.250
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.750 --> 00:24:00.290
Hitori no toki mo

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:03.710
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:09.960
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.960 --> 00:24:13.460
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.460 --> 00:24:16.880
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:23.380
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.750 --> 00:24:29.710
Ano hi no anata ga...
